      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1368890028,
      "text": "Shepherdia canadensis, commonly called Canada buffaloberry, russet buffaloberry, soopolallie, soapberry, or foamberry is one of a small number of shrubs of the genus Shepherdia that bears edible berries."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Shepherdia canadensis",
